<title>POLAND: BRE nets 13.2 mln zloty in April.</title>
<headline>BRE nets 13.2 mln zloty in April.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish Bank Rozwoju Eksportu SA netted 13.2 million zlotys in April and had a gross profit of 14.8 million zlotys, the bank's deputy president Jan Zielinski said on Monday.</p>
<p>He told Reuters that for the first four months of the year, the bank had a net profit fo 38.4 million zlotys and 52.1 million zloty gross profit.</p>
<p>The bank's comparable results were not immediately available. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
